  "definition": "Traps Required",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-03-19",
  "historyNote": "#8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1203.07); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10 (from Env-Wq 1203.05); ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
